<title>USA: L.A. firm holds 5.5 pct Allstar Inns stake.</title>
<headline>L.A. firm holds 5.5 pct Allstar Inns stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rainbow Fund Inc, a Los Angeles-based investment firm, said Thursday it holds a 5.5 percent stake or 54,019 common shares in Allstar Inns Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, thefirm said its stake includes the purchase of 750 shares on September 12 at $22.75 a share.</p>
<p>It said it holds the stake for passive investment purposes.</p>
</text>
